	(text "The LMR38020S has a maximum input voltage of 80V. D2 TVS diode has a reverse stand off voltage of 40V,\nand a maximum clamping voltage of 64.5V. The clamping voltage is well within the limits of the LMR38020S,\nand 40V is well above the maximum normal voltage of a 24V lead-acid battery system.\n\nThe main thing that sets the maximum input voltage of this device is the TVS diode."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
